# R6 sequential companion to R6_Acceptance_Test.md.
# PREPARE ONLY: await Owner approval of both files and explicit execution authorization.
# Actual AI/manual results: 待執行（等待 Owner review）. Record results in Markdown.
# Read Markdown prerequisites, DB snapshots, startup/full regression, lifecycle fixture
# setup, concurrency harness and cleanup. Do not run all requests blindly.
# Keep retained R4 members/R5 Forms; each independent run uses a fresh matching runId.
# Credentials and tokens below are placeholders; obtain retained R4 password locally.
# REST Client: Clear All Cookies first. @no-cookie-jar on every request.
# Copy only access_token's VALUE from each login into its token variable.
# Restore password/token placeholders after the run; never commit secrets.
# R6-12a/12b are PARALLEL TEMPLATES; use the Markdown harness, not sequential Send.

@apiBase = http://localhost:5000
@runId = r6-acceptance-20261003-01
@testPassword = ENTER_RETAINED_R4_PASSWORD_LOCALLY
@memberAEmail = r4-member-a-r4-acceptance-20261001-01@example.test
@memberBEmail = r4-member-b-r4-acceptance-20261001-01@example.test
@memberAToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_VALUE_ONLY
@memberBToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_VALUE_ONLY
@listPage = 1
@missingFormId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
@retainedDeletedFormId = PASTE_VERIFIED_R5_SOFT_DELETED_FORM_ID_FROM_01
@editorFormId = PASTE_FORM_ID_FROM_03a
@scopeFormId = PASTE_FORM_ID_FROM_03b
@concurrentFormId = PASTE_FORM_ID_FROM_03c
@qText = PASTE_TEXT_ID_FROM_03a
@qNumber = PASTE_NUMBER_ID_FROM_03a
